既然你時間都可以配合，回覆時可以直接表明兩天都方便，並主動列出具體時段（例如上午幾點到幾點），方便對方直接發送會議邀請。
以下提供兩種常用的回覆範本：
選項一：簡潔直接（推薦）
> Hi [對方名字/Team],
> Both Thursday and Friday mornings work well for me.
> You can schedule it anytime between 9:30 AM and 12:00 PM on either day. Please feel free to send over the meeting invite directly once confirmed with SKHK.
> Thanks!
> 
選項二：更精簡的快訊風格
> Hi [對方名字/Team],
> I am flexible for both Thursday and Friday morning.
> Please go ahead and pick whichever slot works best for SKHK and HKAML, and include me in the invite. Thanks!
> 
